          "comment": "# Camera Move\n\n**Camera Move** turns a single still frame into a directed camera shot using the shared 30-move vocabulary.\n\n1. **Still Image**, **Camera Move**, **Speed**, and **Subject Action** feed into **Template** to compose the camera direction.\n2. **ImageToVideo** renders the clip at the requested duration using your selected video provider (Kling, Veo, Seedance, Wan, or a local Wan 2.2 model)."
